{"title_zh":"包饺子","subtitle_zh":"一个外国学生第一次包饺子","title_en":"Making Dumplings","subtitle_en":"A foreign student makes dumplings for the first time","author":"Text and translation by Claude (Anthropic)","type":"meta"}
{"type":"p","id":"intro","segs":[{"en":"Tom is a foreign student learning Chinese in China.","tok":[["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],["是","shì"],["一","yī"],["个","gè"],["外国","wàiguó"],["留学生","liúxuéshēng"],"，",["在","zài"],["中国","Zhōngguó"],["学习","xuéxí"],["汉语","Hànyǔ"],"。"]},{"en":"Gao Tian is his classmate and also his good friend.","tok":[["高天","Gāo Tiān","Gao Tian, Tom's classmate","N"],["是","shì"],["他","tā"],["的","de"],["同学","tóngxué"],"，",["也","yě"],["是","shì"],["他","tā"],["的","de"],["好","hǎo"],["朋友","péngyou"],"。"]},{"en":"The New Year was coming, and Gao Tian said, “Tom, come to my place for the New Year! We'll make dumplings together.”","tok":[["快","kuài"],["过年","guònián"],["了","le"],"，",["高天","Gāo Tiān","Gao Tian, Tom's classmate","N"],["说","shuō"],"：","“",["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],"，",["过年","guònián"],["的","de"],["时候","shíhou"],["你","nǐ"],["来","lái"],["我","wǒ"],["家","jiā"],["吧","ba"],"！",["我们","wǒmen"],["一起","yīqǐ"],["包","bāo"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],"。","”"]},{"en":"Tom was delighted, but he had never made dumplings, or even seen anyone else make them.","tok":[["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],["很","hěn"],["高兴","gāoxìng"],"，",["可是","kěshì"],["他","tā"],["没","méi"],["包","bāo"],["过","guo"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],"，",["也","yě"],["没","méi"],["看见","kànjiàn"],["过","guo"],["别人","biéren"],["包","bāo"],"。"]}],"zh":"汤姆是一个外国留学生，在中国学习汉语。高天是他的同学，也是他的好朋友。快过年了，高天说：“汤姆，过年的时候你来我家吧！我们一起包饺子。”汤姆很高兴，可是他没包过饺子，也没看见过别人包。"}
{"type":"h2","id":"h-visit","segs":[{"en":"Visiting a Friend","tok":[["去","qù"],["朋友","péngyou"],["家","jiā"]]}],"zh":"去朋友家"}
{"type":"p","id":"visit-1","segs":[{"en":"On the afternoon of New Year's Eve, Tom arrived at Gao Tian's home.","tok":[["过年","guònián"],["那天","nàtiān"],["下午","xiàwǔ"],"，",["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],["来到","láidào"],["高天","Gāo Tiān","Gao Tian, Tom's classmate","N"],["家","jiā"],"。"]},{"en":"Gao Tian's father, mother and little sister were all at home.","tok":[["高天","Gāo Tiān","Gao Tian, Tom's classmate","N"],["的","de"],["爸爸","bàba"],"、",["妈妈","māma"],["和","hé"],["妹妹","mèimei"],["都","dōu"],["在","zài"],["家","jiā"],"。"]},{"en":"“Hello!” said Tom. “Happy New Year!”","tok":[["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],["说","shuō"],"：","“",["您","nín"],["好","hǎo"],"！",["新年","xīnnián"],["好","hǎo"],"！","”"]},{"en":"Gao Tian's mother smiled. “Welcome, welcome! Come in quickly, it's too cold outside.”","tok":[["高天","Gāo Tiān","Gao Tian, Tom's classmate","N"],["的","de"],["妈妈","māma"],["笑","xiào"],["着","zhe"],["说","shuō"],"：","“",["欢迎","huānyíng"],["欢迎","huānyíng"],"！",["快","kuài"],["进来","jìnlai"],"，",["外边","wàibian"],["太","tài"],["冷","lěng"],["了","le"],"。","”"]}],"zh":"过年那天下午，汤姆来到高天家。高天的爸爸、妈妈和妹妹都在家。汤姆说：“您好！新年好！”高天的妈妈笑着说：“欢迎欢迎！快进来，外边太冷了。”"}
{"type":"p","id":"visit-2","segs":[{"en":"The table was covered with things: a big bowl of meat and vegetables, and lots of little white things laid out one by one.","tok":[["桌子","zhuōzi"],["上","shàng"],["放","fàng"],["着","zhe"],["很","hěn"],["多","duō"],["东西","dōngxi"],"：",["一","yī"],["大","dà"],["碗","wǎn"],["肉","ròu"],["和","hé"],["菜","cài"],"，",["还有","háiyǒu"],["很","hěn"],["多","duō"],["白色","báisè"],["的","de"],"、",["小小","xiǎoxiǎo"],["的","de"],["东西","dōngxi"],"，",["一","yī"],["个","gè"],["一","yī"],["个","gè"],["放","fàng"],["在","zài"],["那儿","nàr"],"。"]},{"en":"“What are these?” asked Tom.","tok":[["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],["问","wèn"],"：","“",["这些","zhèxiē"],["是","shì"],["什么","shénme"],"？","”"]},{"en":"Gao Tian's little sister said, “These are the dumplings' coats!”","tok":[["高天","Gāo Tiān","Gao Tian, Tom's classmate","N"],["的","de"],["妹妹","mèimei"],["说","shuō"],"：","“",["这","zhè"],["是","shì"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],["的","de"],["衣服","yīfu"],"！","”"]},{"en":"Everyone laughed.","tok":[["大家","dàjiā"],["都","dōu"],["笑","xiào"],["了","le"],"。"]},{"en":"“My sister's right,” said Gao Tian. “First we make the dumplings' ‘coats’, and then we put the meat and vegetables inside them.”","tok":[["高天","Gāo Tiān","Gao Tian, Tom's classmate","N"],["说","shuō"],"：","“",["我","wǒ"],["妹妹","mèimei"],["说","shuō"],["得","de"],["对","duì"],"。",["我们","wǒmen"],["先","xiān"],["做好","zuòhǎo"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],["的","de"],"‘",["衣服","yīfu"],"’","，",["然后","ránhòu"],["在","zài"],"‘",["衣服","yīfu"],"’",["里","lǐ"],["放","fàng"],["肉","ròu"],["和","hé"],["菜","cài"],"。","”"]}],"zh":"桌子上放着很多东西：一大碗肉和菜，还有很多白色的、小小的东西，一个一个放在那儿。汤姆问：“这些是什么？”高天的妹妹说：“这是饺子的衣服！”大家都笑了。高天说：“我妹妹说得对。我们先做好饺子的‘衣服’，然后在‘衣服’里放肉和菜。”"}
{"type":"h2","id":"h-clothes","segs":[{"en":"The Dumplings' Coats","tok":[["饺子","jiǎozi"],["的","de"],["衣服","yīfu"]]}],"zh":"饺子的衣服"}
{"type":"p","id":"clothes-1","segs":[{"en":"Gao Tian's mother taught Tom how to make dumplings.","tok":[["高天","Gāo Tiān","Gao Tian, Tom's classmate","N"],["的","de"],["妈妈","māma"],["教","jiāo"],["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],["包","bāo"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],"。"]},{"en":"As she worked, she said, “Watch my hands. First take one ‘coat’ and put it on your left hand. Then use your chopsticks to put a little meat and vegetables in the middle. Don't put in too much. Finally, close it up with both hands, and there's your dumpling.”","tok":[["她","tā"],["一边","yībiān"],["包","bāo"],"，",["一边","yībiān"],["说","shuō"],"：","“",["你","nǐ"],["看","kàn"],["着","zhe"],["我","wǒ"],["的","de"],["手","shǒu"],"。",["先","xiān"],["拿","ná"],["一","yī"],["个","gè"],"‘",["衣服","yīfu"],"’","，",["放","fàng"],["在","zài"],["左手","zuǒshǒu"],["上","shàng"],"。",["然后","ránhòu"],["用","yòng"],["筷子","kuàizi"],["在","zài"],["中间","zhōngjiān"],["放","fàng"],["一点儿","yīdiǎnr"],["肉","ròu"],["和","hé"],["菜","cài"],"，",["不要","bùyào"],["放","fàng"],["太","tài"],["多","duō"],"。",["最后","zuìhòu"],["用","yòng"],["两","liǎng"],["只","zhī"],["手","shǒu"],["关上","guānshang"],["它","tā"],"，",["一","yī"],["个","gè"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],["就","jiù"],["包","bāo"],["好","hǎo"],["了","le"],"。","”"]},{"en":"She worked very fast, one after another, and every one was beautiful.","tok":[["她","tā"],["包","bāo"],["得","de"],["很","hěn"],["快","kuài"],"，",["一","yī"],["个","gè"],["又","yòu"],["一","yī"],["个","gè"],"，",["都","dōu"],["很","hěn"],["漂亮","piàoliang"],"。"]}],"zh":"高天的妈妈教汤姆包饺子。她一边包，一边说：“你看着我的手。先拿一个‘衣服’，放在左手上。然后用筷子在中间放一点儿肉和菜，不要放太多。最后用两只手关上它，一个饺子就包好了。”她包得很快，一个又一个，都很漂亮。"}
{"type":"p","id":"clothes-2","segs":[{"en":"Tom understood what she said and what she did, but doing it himself was another matter.","tok":[["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],["听","tīng"],["懂","dǒng"],["了","le"],"，",["也","yě"],["看","kàn"],["懂","dǒng"],["了","le"],"，",["可是","kěshì"],["自己","zìjǐ"],["包","bāo"],["的","de"],["时候","shíhou"],["就","jiù"],["不","bù"],["一样","yīyàng"],["了","le"],"。"]},{"en":"His first dumpling had too much meat in it, and before he had even closed it, the filling ran out.","tok":[["他","tā"],["的","de"],["第一","dìyī"],["个","gè"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],["放","fàng"],["了","le"],["太","tài"],["多","duō"],["肉","ròu"],"，",["还","hái"],["没","méi"],["包","bāo"],["好","hǎo"],"，",["肉","ròu"],["和","hé"],["菜","cài"],["就","jiù"],["跑","pǎo"],["出来","chūlai"],["了","le"],"。"]},{"en":"His second dumpling was tiny, like a little bird.","tok":[["第二","dì'èr"],["个","gè"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],["很","hěn"],["小","xiǎo"],"，",["像","xiàng"],["一","yī"],["只","zhī"],["小","xiǎo"],["鸟","niǎo"],"。"]},{"en":"His third was long, like a little boat.","tok":[["第三","dìsān"],["个","gè"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],["很","hěn"],["长","cháng"],"，",["像","xiàng"],["一","yī"],["只","zhī"],["小","xiǎo"],["船","chuán"],"。"]},{"en":"Gao Tian's little sister looked at Tom's dumplings and laughed so hard she couldn't speak.","tok":[["高天","Gāo Tiān","Gao Tian, Tom's classmate","N"],["的","de"],["妹妹","mèimei"],["看","kàn"],["着","zhe"],["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],["的","de"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],"，",["笑","xiào"],["得","de"],["说","shuō"],["不","bù"],["出","chū"],["话","huà"],["来","lái"],"。"]}],"zh":"汤姆听懂了，也看懂了，可是自己包的时候就不一样了。他的第一个饺子放了太多肉，还没包好，肉和菜就跑出来了。第二个饺子很小，像一只小鸟。第三个饺子很长，像一只小船。高天的妹妹看着汤姆的饺子，笑得说不出话来。"}
{"type":"p","id":"clothes-3","segs":[{"en":"Tom felt a little embarrassed.","tok":[["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],["有点儿","yǒudiǎnr"],["不好意思","bùhǎoyìsi"],"。"]},{"en":"“Don't worry!” said Gao Tian. “The first time I made dumplings, mine looked even worse than yours.”","tok":[["高天","Gāo Tiān","Gao Tian, Tom's classmate","N"],["说","shuō"],"：","“",["没关系","méi guānxi"],"！",["我","wǒ"],["第一","dìyī"],["次","cì"],["包","bāo"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],["的","de"],["时候","shíhou"],"，",["包","bāo"],["得","de"],["比","bǐ"],["你","nǐ"],["还","hái"],["难看","nánkàn"],"。","”"]},{"en":"Gao Tian's father sat down next to Tom, took his hands and showed him. “Don't rush. First put in a bit less meat, then close it up a bit more slowly.”","tok":[["高天","Gāo Tiān","Gao Tian, Tom's classmate","N"],["的","de"],["爸爸","bàba"],["坐","zuò"],["到","dào"],["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],["旁边","pángbiān"],"，",["拿","ná"],["着","zhe"],["他","tā"],["的","de"],["手","shǒu"],["教","jiāo"],["他","tā"],"：","“",["别","bié"],["急","jí"],"。",["先","xiān"],["放","fàng"],["少","shǎo"],["一点儿","yīdiǎnr"],["肉","ròu"],"，",["然后","ránhòu"],["慢","màn"],["一点儿","yīdiǎnr"],["关上","guānshang"],"。","”"]},{"en":"Tom made another one. This time the filling didn't escape!","tok":[["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],["又","yòu"],["包","bāo"],["了","le"],["一","yī"],["个","gè"],"。",["这","zhè"],["次","cì"],"，",["肉","ròu"],["和","hé"],["菜","cài"],["没有","méiyǒu"],["跑","pǎo"],["出来","chūlai"],"！"]}],"zh":"汤姆有点儿不好意思。高天说：“没关系！我第一次包饺子的时候，包得比你还难看。”高天的爸爸坐到汤姆旁边，拿着他的手教他：“别急。先放少一点儿肉，然后慢一点儿关上。”汤姆又包了一个。这次，肉和菜没有跑出来！"}
{"type":"p","id":"clothes-4","segs":[{"en":"After an hour, Tom's dumplings were looking better and better.","tok":[["包","bāo"],["了","le"],["一","yī"],["个","gè"],["小时","xiǎoshí"],"，",["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],["的","de"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],["越来越","yuèláiyuè"],["好看","hǎokàn"],["了","le"],"。"]},{"en":"Everyone chatted as they worked.","tok":[["大家","dàjiā"],["一边","yībiān"],["包","bāo"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],"，",["一边","yībiān"],["说话","shuōhuà"],"。"]},{"en":"Gao Tian's father told Tom that at New Year, lots of families in the north eat dumplings.","tok":[["高天","Gāo Tiān","Gao Tian, Tom's classmate","N"],["的","de"],["爸爸","bàba"],["告诉","gàosu"],["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],"，",["过年","guònián"],["的","de"],["时候","shíhou"],"，",["很","hěn"],["多","duō"],["北方","běifāng"],["人","rén"],["家里","jiālǐ"],["都","dōu"],["吃","chī"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],"。"]},{"en":"Some say dumplings look like money from long ago, so if you eat dumplings at New Year, you'll have money in the year ahead.","tok":[["有人","yǒurén"],["说","shuō"],"，",["饺子","jiǎozi"],["的","de"],["样子","yàngzi"],["像","xiàng"],["很久","hěnjiǔ"],["以前","yǐqián"],["的","de"],["钱","qián"],"，",["所以","suǒyǐ"],["过年","guònián"],["吃","chī"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],"，",["明年","míngnián"],["会","huì"],["有","yǒu"],["钱","qián"],"。"]}],"zh":"包了一个小时，汤姆的饺子越来越好看了。大家一边包饺子，一边说话。高天的爸爸告诉汤姆，过年的时候，很多北方人家里都吃饺子。有人说，饺子的样子像很久以前的钱，所以过年吃饺子，明年会有钱。"}
{"type":"p","id":"clothes-5","segs":[{"en":"Just then, Gao Tian's mother took out a one-yuan coin, washed it until it was spotless, and put it inside a dumpling.","tok":[["这时候","zhèshíhou"],"，",["高天","Gāo Tiān","Gao Tian, Tom's classmate","N"],["的","de"],["妈妈","māma"],["拿出","náchū"],["一","yī"],["块","kuài"],["钱","qián"],"，",["洗","xǐ"],["得","de"],["干干净净","gāngānjìngjìng"],"，",["放","fàng"],["在","zài"],["一","yī"],["个","gè"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],["里","lǐ"],"。"]},{"en":"She said, “Whoever gets this dumpling will find that everything goes smoothly next year.”","tok":[["她","tā"],["说","shuō"],"：","“",["吃到","chīdào"],["这","zhè"],["个","gè"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],["的","de"],["人","rén"],"，",["明年","míngnián"],["什么","shénme"],["事","shì"],["都","dōu"],["会","huì"],["很","hěn"],["顺利","shùnlì"],"。","”"]},{"en":"Tom didn't see which dumpling she put it in.","tok":[["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],["没","méi"],["看到","kàndào"],["她","tā"],["放","fàng"],["在","zài"],["哪","nǎ"],["个","gè"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],["里","lǐ"],["了","le"],"。"]}],"zh":"这时候，高天的妈妈拿出一块钱，洗得干干净净，放在一个饺子里。她说：“吃到这个饺子的人，明年什么事都会很顺利。”汤姆没看到她放在哪个饺子里了。"}
{"type":"h2","id":"h-coin","segs":[{"en":"The Lucky Dumpling","tok":[["有","yǒu"],["钱","qián"],["的","de"],["饺子","jiǎozi"]]}],"zh":"有钱的饺子"}
{"type":"p","id":"coin-1","segs":[{"en":"All the dumplings were made: more than a hundred altogether.","tok":[["饺子","jiǎozi"],["都","dōu"],["包","bāo"],["完","wán"],["了","le"],"，",["一共","yīgòng"],["一百","yībǎi"],["多","duō"],["个","gè"],"。"]},{"en":"When the water was boiling, Mum put the dumplings in one by one.","tok":[["水","shuǐ"],["开","kāi"],["了","le"],["以后","yǐhòu"],"，",["妈妈","māma"],["一","yī"],["个","gè"],["一","yī"],["个","gè"],["放","fàng"],["进","jìn"],["了","le"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],"。"]},{"en":"Ten-odd minutes later, the dumplings were ready.","tok":[["十","shí"],["几","jǐ"],["分钟","fēnzhōng"],["以后","yǐhòu"],"，",["饺子","jiǎozi"],["好","hǎo"],["了","le"],"。"]},{"en":"Everyone sat round the table and ate.","tok":[["大家","dàjiā"],["坐","zuò"],["在","zài"],["桌子","zhuōzi"],["旁边","pángbiān"],["吃","chī"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],"。"]}],"zh":"饺子都包完了，一共一百多个。水开了以后，妈妈一个一个放进了饺子。十几分钟以后，饺子好了。大家坐在桌子旁边吃饺子。"}
{"type":"p","id":"coin-2","segs":[{"en":"Tom found his own “little birds” and “little boats”.","tok":[["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],["找到","zhǎodào"],["了","le"],["自己","zìjǐ"],["包","bāo"],["的","de"],"“",["小","xiǎo"],["鸟","niǎo"],"”",["和","hé"],"“",["小","xiǎo"],["船","chuán"],"”","。"]},{"en":"They didn't look nice, but they tasted good.","tok":[["它们","tāmen"],["不","bù"],["好看","hǎokàn"],"，",["可是","kěshì"],["味道","wèidao"],["很","hěn"],["好","hǎo"],"。"]},{"en":"He kept saying as he ate, “These are delicious!”","tok":[["他","tā"],["一边","yībiān"],["吃","chī"],"，",["一边","yībiān"],["说","shuō"],"：","“",["太","tài"],["好吃","hǎochī"],["了","le"],"！","”"]},{"en":"Suddenly he bit on something that wasn't meat and wasn't vegetables.","tok":[["忽然","hūrán"],"，",["他","tā"],["吃到","chīdào"],["了","le"],["一","yī"],["个","gè"],["东西","dōngxi"],"，",["不","bù"],["是","shì"],["肉","ròu"],"，",["也","yě"],["不","bù"],["是","shì"],["菜","cài"],"。"]},{"en":"He took it out to look: it was a one-yuan coin!","tok":[["他","tā"],["拿","ná"],["出来","chūlai"],["一","yī"],["看","kàn"],"，",["是","shì"],["一","yī"],["块","kuài"],["钱","qián"],"！"]}],"zh":"汤姆找到了自己包的“小鸟”和“小船”。它们不好看，可是味道很好。他一边吃，一边说：“太好吃了！”忽然，他吃到了一个东西，不是肉，也不是菜。他拿出来一看，是一块钱！"}
{"type":"p","id":"coin-3","segs":[{"en":"Everyone laughed and said, “Tom got it! Tom's going to have a great year!”","tok":[["大家","dàjiā"],["都","dōu"],["笑","xiào"],["着","zhe"],["说","shuō"],"：","“",["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],["吃到","chīdào"],["了","le"],"！",["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],["明年","míngnián"],["会","huì"],["很","hěn"],["顺利","shùnlì"],"！","”"]},{"en":"Gao Tian's little sister looked at the dumpling and said, “Mum, this dumpling looks like a little boat. Tom made it himself!”","tok":[["高天","Gāo Tiān","Gao Tian, Tom's classmate","N"],["的","de"],["妹妹","mèimei"],["看","kàn"],["了","le"],["看","kàn"],["那","nà"],["个","gè"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],"，",["说","shuō"],"：","“",["妈妈","māma"],"，",["这","zhè"],["个","gè"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],["像","xiàng"],["一","yī"],["只","zhī"],["小","xiǎo"],["船","chuán"],"，",["是","shì"],["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],["自己","zìjǐ"],["包","bāo"],["的","de"],"！","”"]},{"en":"Mum smiled. “Yes, I put the coin in one of his. It's Tom's first New Year with us, so the coin should be his.”","tok":[["妈妈","māma"],["笑","xiào"],["了","le"],"：","“",["对","duì"],"，",["钱","qián"],["是","shì"],["我","wǒ"],["放","fàng"],["在","zài"],["他","tā"],["的","de"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],["里","lǐ"],["的","de"],"。",["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],["第一","dìyī"],["次","cì"],["在","zài"],["我们","wǒmen"],["家","jiā"],["过年","guònián"],"，",["这","zhè"],["块","kuài"],["钱","qián"],["应该","yīnggāi"],["是","shì"],["他","tā"],["的","de"],"。","”"]}],"zh":"大家都笑着说：“汤姆吃到了！汤姆明年会很顺利！”高天的妹妹看了看那个饺子，说：“妈妈，这个饺子像一只小船，是汤姆自己包的！”妈妈笑了：“对，钱是我放在他的饺子里的。汤姆第一次在我们家过年，这块钱应该是他的。”"}
{"type":"p","id":"coin-4","segs":[{"en":"Tom was deeply touched.","tok":[["汤姆","Tāngmǔ","Tom, a foreign student","N"],["听","tīng"],["了","le"],"，",["非常","fēicháng"],["感动","gǎndòng"],"。"]},{"en":"Holding the coin, he said, “Thank you all! Next New Year I'm coming to make dumplings again. And by then, my dumplings definitely won't look like little boats!”","tok":[["他","tā"],["拿","ná"],["着","zhe"],["那","nà"],["块","kuài"],["钱","qián"],"，",["说","shuō"],"：","“",["谢谢","xièxie"],["你们","nǐmen"],"！",["明年","míngnián"],["过年","guònián"],"，",["我","wǒ"],["还","hái"],["要","yào"],["来","lái"],["包","bāo"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],"。",["那","nà"],["时候","shíhou"],"，",["我","wǒ"],["的","de"],["饺子","jiǎozi"],["一定","yīdìng"],["不","bù"],["像","xiàng"],["小","xiǎo"],["船","chuán"],["了","le"],"！","”"]}],"zh":"汤姆听了，非常感动。他拿着那块钱，说：“谢谢你们！明年过年，我还要来包饺子。那时候，我的饺子一定不像小船了！”"}
